# Data Analysis Portfolio

A collection of data analysis projects using Excel, and Power BI — 
covering data cleaning, analysis, and dashboard design.

## Projects

### Bike Sales Analysis
Sales, profit, and COGS analysis across country, state, category, and time.
**Tools:** Excel, Power BI, DAX

![dashboard preview](./bike-sales-analysis/images/dashboard-overview.png)

**What I did:**
- Cleaned and structured raw sales data in Excel
- Built dimension and fact tables (star schema)
- Imported into Power BI, created relationships and DAX measures
- Designed an interactive dashboard with drill-down by country/state, 
  filters for category/sub-category, and trends by year/month


## Skills
- Data cleaning and transformation
- Excel
- Dimensional modeling (star schema)
- Power BI dashboards and DAX
